# Ajani, Caller of the Pride, -8: "Create X 2/2 white Cat creature tokens, where X is your life total." Ajani +1s on turns 1, 3 and
# 5 (loyalty 7). On turn 7 the -8 cannot be paid with 7 loyalty (CR 606.6), so Bot1 +1s again to 8. On turn 9 Bot1 first Healing
# Salves itself to 23 life, and the -8 makes 23 Cat tokens, each a 2/2 white Cat: X is the life total as the ability resolves
# (CR 608.2h), not the 20 it started with. Ajani goes to the graveyard with no loyalty left (CR 704.5i).

